From: Etienne Carriere <etienne.carriere@foss.st.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Nov 2023 11:09:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 0084/1695] pta: stats: rename statistics PTA

Rename statistics PTA to "stats.pta" for consistency.

Signed-off-by: Etienne Carriere <etienne.carriere@foss.st.com>
[cherry-picked from 37a87df89b44148813ef6b96dd65325241ccd0c4]
Signed-off-by: Etienne Carriere <etienne.carriere@foss.st.com>

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git e1e18c3d0b8f0629c1f16e44f580b551793f1e0a pta: stats: rename statistics PTA]
Change-Id: I8063ee55490646b3b9a989619128cca8d04db88c
---
 core/pta/stats.c | 4 +---
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/core/pta/stats.c b/core/pta/stats.c
index 41a8975d7..86dc3d193 100644
--- a/core/pta/stats.c
+++ b/core/pta/stats.c
@@ -15,8 +15,6 @@
 #include <tee_api_types.h>
 #include <trace.h>
 
-#define TA_NAME		"stats.ta"
-
 static TEE_Result get_alloc_stats(uint32_t type, TEE_Param p[TEE_NUM_PARAMS])
 {
 	struct pta_stats_alloc *stats = NULL;
@@ -200,6 +198,6 @@ static TEE_Result invoke_command(void *psess __unused,
 	return TEE_ERROR_BAD_PARAMETERS;
 }
 
-pseudo_ta_register(.uuid = STATS_UUID, .name = TA_NAME,
+pseudo_ta_register(.uuid = STATS_UUID, .name = "stats.pta",
 		   .flags = PTA_DEFAULT_FLAGS,
 		   .invoke_command_entry_point = invoke_command);
